  "solution": "Giá trị nhỏ nhất, lớn nhất trong mẫu số liệu trên là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Bảng tần số của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm như sau\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Chiều cao</td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td>Số người</td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>9</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>11</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>7</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\t\t\n\t\tNhóm có tần số lớn nhất trong mẫu số liệu trên là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. Khi đó mốt của mẫu số liệu trên là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>49</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>17</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
